  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Armies of the Lord**: rare: 14 archived performances [2]\n- **Need More Bandages**: rare: 7 archived performances [2]\n- **Charlie Sheen Reaches Out to the Feds**: rare: 14 archived performances [2]\n- **Dawn of Revelation**: rare: 12 archived performances [2]\n- **Onions**: back after 63 archived shows (917 days) [2]\n- **Good Morning to All Vultures**: back after 194 archived shows (2923 days); mythic rare: 2 archived performances [2]\n- **Isaiah 45 23**: back after 123 archived shows (1489 days); rare: 13 archived performances [2]\n- **Genesis 3 23**: rare: 8 archived performances [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **tMG2026-05-30** (recommended): soundboard; 25 songs; 111 min [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Stage talk about: No Children, abridged Overture [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **tMG2026-05-30**: taped by Kyle Kennelly & Emerald Green; transferred by Kyle Kennelly; source: SBD [Engineer: Erich Miller] > PCM-A10 + Tascam FR-AV2 > DPA4060s (Healy On Stage) [1]. Also: The recording's mix was done by Erich Miller, and the band and their management allow live taping [1]",
